WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
Start this payment walkthrough with a
natural request:

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:06.180
I would like to send one USDC to Alice.

3
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.820
If the request instead says one

4
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.640
or two, the agent asks:

5
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.020
do you mean one or two?

6
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.470
After clarification, inspect the exact token
amount.

7
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.270
The flow uses official Pharos Chain

8
00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.750
MCP checks for balance, contract details,
fees,

9
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.710
and a read only transfer simulation.

10
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.170
These are review steps, not a completed
payment.

11
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.560
Read the human readable summary:

12
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.960
sender, recipient, asset, amount, and fee
budget.

13
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.920
Confirmation applies to this version only.

14
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.860
Revise or cancel the request, and

15
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.960
the old confirmation becomes invalid.

16
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.050
After confirmation and fresh checks, export

17
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:44.510
one unsigned request or an ordered batch.

18
00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.550
The receiving wallet must review it
independently.

19
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.050
This flow never requests private keys,

20
00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.870
signs a transaction, or broadcasts one.
